      "children": [
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "CCjqA",
          "name": "Sheet Header",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "VVsHa",
              "name": "H1",
              "fill": "#2B141C",
              "content": "設計語言 v3 · 褪色相片粉調",
              "lineHeight": 1.25,
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
              "fontSize": 34,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "QwdaI",
              "name": "H1 Sub",
              "fill": "#553040",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "取材自家族相簿裡真正會發生的事：彩色相紙的青色染料最先死掉，三十年後的家庭照整體偏洋紅。所以整個 app 只有一條染料階——從受光的紙（blush）到留在暗處的墨（桑葚），連中性階每一階都是 rose（B ≥ G）。照片是全app唯一不粉的東西。所有對比值為實測（WCAG 2.1 相對亮度），一律以各自的最不利點計。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
              "fontSize": 17,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "PsZ61",
          "name": "Sec ① 色彩 Color",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 16,
          "padding": [
            44,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "TGNn7",
              "name": "SecHead",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 4,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "WL3Gh",
                  "name": "T",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "content": "① 色彩 Color",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 22,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Y4zQ26",
                  "name": "S",
                  "fill": "#553040",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "色彩極度稀缺：整份設計只有一個飽和色（accent 深玫紅 #8E2447），每畫面最多出現一次實心。連結用墨色＋底線，icon／badge 一律中性。中性階本身就是粉——每一階 B ≥ G（rose 家族），不是在米色上加粉紅濾鏡：對照軌 A 的暖白系統每一階 B < G（cream 家族），色相由 13–39° 轉到 334–356°。錯誤色（磚紅 hue 9）是唯一家族外的色相，且錯誤永遠同時用形（粗底線）與字說明，不靠顏色單獨承載。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
