                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "vWvs2",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "色彩：Asset Catalog 建 Color Set，Any/Dark 兩欄，名稱對齊 token（bg／bg-lit／surface／mount-edge／surface-2／text-primary／text-secondary／accent／accent-text／accent-soft／on-accent／control-line／border／danger／success／photo-corner／corner-fold／scrim-ink／scrim-fade／ground-fade／paper-shadow／apple-bg／apple-fg／google-bg／google-fg／google-line）。text-tertiary 已廢除。兩條硬規則：① surface-2 只承載 text-primary 與 text-secondary（danger／success／accent-text 落在它上面不到 AAA）；② border 是純裝飾髮絲線，任何承載意義的邊界（輸入框、外框鈕、焦點）一律用 control-line。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "nU0MA",
              "name": "iNew",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "y3WJna",
                  "name": "d",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "content": "—",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "TWjpE",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "漸層只有三道，各有出處，不得自行增加（規格見設計語言 ② 漸層）。實作要點：\n① 窗光 window-light＝每個畫面根層的背景，RadialGradient(colors:[bg-lit,bg], center:.topLeading 偏移 (55pt,17pt), startRadius:0, endRadius: 依實體尺度)。關鍵：橢圓固定 668×1150pt、圓心固定 55/17pt，是**點數**不是百分比——iPad 上不要按比例放大，否則同一盞光在兩台機器上大小不一樣。\n② 印相罩 print-scrim＝壓在照片上的 LinearGradient(stops: scrim-ink@0, scrim-ink@0.40, scrim-fade@1.0)，由上往下。0→0.40 的平段不可省，狀態列必須整條落在滿罩區。\n③ 裱托 mount-shadow＝紙卡背景（見紙卡母題）。\n壓在漸層上的文字，對比一律以最不利點算：窗光算暗端 bg、印相罩算「照片該處是純白」、裱托算深端 mount-edge。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "yZDL0",
              "name": "iNew",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
